Given a job application, extract relevant information and provide a summary.

// @rule RULE:extract_name category=format
Extract the applicant's name.

// @rule RULE:extract_email category=format
Extract the applicant's email address.

// @rule RULE:extract_experience category=format
Extract the applicant's work experience, listing job titles, companies, and dates.

// @rule RULE:extract_skills category=format
Extract the applicant's skills.

// @rule RULE:summarize_application category=safety
Summarize the application in a concise and informative way. Do not include any personally identifiable information beyond name and email.

// @condition CONDITION:is_valid_email
The email address is in a valid format.

// @condition CONDITION:has_experience
The application includes work experience.

{% if application.name %}
Applicant Name: {{ application.name }}
{% endif %}

{% if application.email %}
Email Address: {{ application.email }}
{% if CONDITION:is_valid_email %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}

{% if CONDITION:has_experience %}
Work Experience:
{% for experience in application.experience %}
  - {{ experience.title }} at {{ experience.company }} from {{ experience.startDate }} to {{ experience.endDate }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

Skills:
{% for skill in application.skills %}
- {{ skill }}
{% endfor %}

// @breakpoint BREAKPOINT:summary_generation [conditionRef=CONDITION:has_experience]

Summary:
Based on the provided information, this applicant appears to be {{ application.summary }} . 

{% if application.notes %}
Additional Notes: {{ application.notes }}
{% endif %}
